WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.461
To put numbers on it: on Citeseer at a hundred and
forty injected nodes,

00:00:04.541 --> 00:00:10.075
the certified ratio jumps from zero percent under
sample-wise certification to eighty-one

00:00:10.155 --> 00:00:13.607
point two percent with the customized collective method.

00:00:13.687 --> 00:00:17.391
That collective linear program solves in roughly
one minute.

00:00:17.471 --> 00:00:24.014
The customized relaxation improves on the standard
one by up to two hundred and sixteen percent relative,

00:00:24.094 --> 00:00:29.312
and it sits only about five percent below the exact
but far slower integer solution.

00:00:29.392 --> 00:00:32.213
In short, injecting five percent of the graph,

00:00:32.293 --> 00:00:37.070
the certified ratio climbs from zero to over eighty
percent on both datasets.
